            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If we wish to sum the squares of the first <span class=\"math\">[MATH: N]</span> integers, an easy way is to use the following formula:</p>",
            "readable_text": "If we wish to sum the squares of the first [MATH: N] integers, an easy way is to use the following formula:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(N)n^{2}|= 1^{2} + 2^{2} + 3^{2} + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1)^{2} + N^{2}; = 1 + 4 + 9 + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1)^{2} + N^{2}; = (1)/(6)N(N + 1)(2N + 1)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(N)n^{2}|= 1^{2} + 2^{2} + 3^{2} + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1)^{2} + N^{2}; = 1 + 4 + 9 + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1)^{2} + N^{2}; = (1)/(6)N(N + 1)(2N + 1)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Since we also know that </p>",
            "readable_text": "Since we also know that",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(N)n|= 1 + 2 + 3 + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1) + N; = (1)/(2)N(N + 1),]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(N)n|= 1 + 2 + 3 + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1) + N; = (1)/(2)N(N + 1),]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>we can use these formulas to evaluate any series of the form </p>",
            "readable_text": "we can use these formulas to evaluate any series of the form",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle{\\sum_{n=1}^N (an^2+bn+c)}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\displaystyle{\\sum_{n=1}^N (an^2+bn+c)}.]",
